%N A400303 a(0) = 1; a(n) = Sum_{k=1..n} 3^(k-1) * binomial(n+k,k) * a(n-k).
%F A400303 a(n) ~ c * n! * 3^n * n^(1 + log(4)) / log(4)^n, where c = 0.260741210414368706575451370765006411037629358518732162...
%F A400303 From _Seiichi Manyama_, Nov 04 2026: (Start)
%F A400303 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = (1-6*x) * (4*A(x*(1-3*x)) - 3).
%F A400303 a(n) is even for n > 0. (End)
%t A400303 a[0]=1; a[n_]:=a[n]=Sum[3^(k-1) * Binomial[n+k, k]*a[n-k], {k, 1, n}]; Table[a[n], {n, 0, 20}]
